OL,3,GNEWSANew Marown commissioner 'over the
OL,4,Amoon' after win
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new member has been elected to Marown
OL,7,FCommissioners by a landslide.
OL,9,FAmanda Collister won 290 votes in
OL,10,FThursday's by-election, while her only
OL,11,Fopponent, Oksana Hargreaves, received
OL,12,F38.
OL,14,FThe vacancy arose after John Lovelady
OL,15,Fstepped down from the board for
OL,16,Fpersonal reasons.
OL,18,FMrs Collister said she was "absolutely
OL,19,Fover the moon" with the result. "I
OL,20,Fcan't quite grasp the amount. It still
OL,21,Fdoesn't feel like a real number."
